                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We can protect Medicaid for those who truly need it by remembering that the 26-year-old, healthy, childless man who\u2019s watching TV at home (and making you pay for his health care) has the responsibility to work.\n\nThose able-bodied people can keep their Medicaid benefits, but they should have to work 20 hours a week to contribute to their communities.",
