                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ohioans are going to work every day\u2014 in factories, in construction, as nurses. And they\u2019re paying for their neighbors\u2019 Medicaid.\n\nAble-bodied, childless adults can and should work to help pay for those benefits.\n\nThat\u2019s part of making America healthier and driving down costs so that we can protect citizens who are truly vulnerable.",
