                "text": "Thank you to the thousands of Ohioans who joined my telephone town hall last night! \n\nWe covered a range of issues affecting hardworking Ohioans, including VA coverage, Medicaid, immigration, and making life more affordable for families.\n\nCustomer service is my commitment to Ohio, and it was an honor to hear from so many of you in real time.",
