                "text": "Marilyn joined my telephone town hall with concerns about Medicaid, and I was thankful for the chance to reassure her that Republicans are working to save the program.\n\nOne of the common-sense ways we can protect Marilyn\u2019s benefits is to make sure that no one who is in the U.S. illegally can keep draining the program at the expense of American citizens.",
