                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What are the things that we can do to save Medicaid?\n\nTo start, let's stop paying for illegal immigrants to get those benefits at the expense of U.S. citizens.\n\nThat will also save American taxpayers money. https://t.co/h27MRcZBqH",
