                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The federal government has wasted $1.1 TRILLION on fraudulent Medicaid payments. \n\nSenate Republicans want to root out waste, fraud, and abuse to protect Medicaid for the vulnerable Americans who need it.",
