                "retweet_count": 61,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If someone isn\u2019t eligible for Medicaid, they shouldn\u2019t be getting generous benefits at the expense of sick, disabled, pregnant Americans and hardworking taxpayers. \n\nBut the abuse of Medicaid is widespread, and Republicans are working to end that abuse. https://t.co/j8q08HdZmN",
