                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Fact: The budget bill Senate Republicans are working to pass PROTECTS Medicaid for vulnerable Ohioans who need it.\n\u00a0\nMargaret joined my telephone town hall recently and allowed me to share with her\u2014and you\u2014that there are no changes in Medicaid eligibility for disabled, pregnant, or elderly Americas who get those benefits.",
