                "reply_count": 14,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Why do Republicans have to protect Medicaid for the Americans who really need it (and protect the taxpayers who are funding it)?\n\u00a0\nBecause federal Medicaid spending is skyrocketing: From $409B in 2019 to an estimated $655B this year.\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s a 60% jump from 2019 to 2025. https://t.co/IqbO5NtSOY",
